  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nGiven equation: (√ 144 ÷ 4) + (6)2 - (25 × 2) + 72 + (32 ÷ 8) × 3 = 52\n\nOption 1) 2 and 8\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __(√ 144 ÷ 4)__ + __**(6)**____**2**__ - __**(25 × 8)**__ + 72 + __**(32 ÷ 2)**__ × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 3 + 36 - 200 + 72 + __**16 × 3**__ = 52\n\n⇒** **__**3 + 36**__ - 200 __**+ 72 + 48**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**159 - 200**__ = 52\n\n⇒ - 41 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 3 and 6\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(√ 144 ÷ 4)**__ + __(3)____2__ - __(25 × 2)__ + 72 + __(32 ÷ 8)__ × 6 = 52​​​\n\n⇒ 3 + 9 - 50 + 72 + __4 × 6__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**3 + 9**__ - 50** **+ __**72 + 24**__ = 52\n\n⇒ **__108 - 50__** = 52\n\n⇒ 58 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3)** 4 and 6\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**​**____**(√ 144 ÷ 6)**__ + __**(4)**____**2**__ - __**(25 × 2)**__ + 72 + __**(32 ÷ 8)**__ × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 2 + 16 - 50 + 72 + __4 × 3__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**2 + 16**__ - 50 + __**72 + 12**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**102 - 50 **__= 52\n\n⇒ **52 = 52 **\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) 2 and 4\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**(√ 144 ÷ 2)**__ + __**(6)**____**2**__ - __**(25 × 4)**__ + 72 + __**(32 ÷ 8)**__ × 3 = 52\n\n⇒ 6 + 36 - 100 + 72 + __4 × 3__ = 52\n\n⇒ __6 + 36__ - 100 + __72 + 12__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**126 - 100**__ = 52\n\n⇒ 76 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (3)\".\n\n62:T30",
